flowchart TB
    Setup[Create warehouse and unit capacity] --> Warehouse[(Warehouse)]
    Receipt[Receive stock] --> Lock[Lock warehouse then inventory balance]
    Lock --> Capacity{Within capacity and valid quantity?}
    Capacity -->|Yes| Store[Commit receipt and ledger entry]
    Capacity -->|No| Reject[Reject without partial update]
    Order[Multi-item order request] --> Select[Find one warehouse with enough of every item]
    Select --> Reserve[Lock balances in deterministic order and reserve]
    Warehouse --> Capacity
    Warehouse --> Select
    Store --> Utilization[Utilization equals recorded on hand divided by unit capacity]
